  - [x] Set `reserve_pool_size=5` for burst capacity
  - [x] Set `max_db_connections=50` (limit to backend PG)
  - [x] Set `server_idle_timeout=600` (reclaim idle connections)
  - [x] Set `query_wait_timeout=120` (fail-fast for queued clients)
  - [x] Add `stats_users=pgbouncer_stats` for monitoring access
  - [x] Document pool sizing rationale in AGENT.md

